{"id": "dmod/concept/holonomicity-preserved-by-direct-image", "status": "external-confirmed", "alignment": "match", "checked_on": "2026-11-19", "checks": [{"source": "nLab", "entry": "holonomic D-module", "url": "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/holonomic+D-module", "last_revised": "2014-02-16", "asserts": "该页 Idea 段原文：「A D-module $M$ on a smooth complex analytic variety $X$ of dimension $n$ is holonomic if its characteristic variety is of dimension $n$. It follows that the characteristic variety of a holonomic D-module is conic and lagrangian.」这一句支持本卡把「完整」等价地读作「特征簇维数 = 底维数」，即 $\\operatorname{holdef}=0$；也就是本卡所讨论的被保持的不变量。需要说明：该页在复解析簇上陈述，讲义在特征零的光滑代数簇上工作，两者设定不同，本卡不据此改动讲义陈述。", "verdict": "match"}, {"source": "nLab", "entry": "Riemann-Hilbert correspondence", "url": "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/Riemann-Hilbert+correspondence", "last_revised": "2024-08-09", "asserts": "该页 Statement 段的 Proposition（Mebkhout, Kashiwara, Beilinson–Bernstein）原文：「The restriction of the functor $dR$ gives an equivalence of categories $D_{rh}^{b}(X^{Zar},\\mathcal{D}_{X})\\to D_{c}^{b}(X^{an},\\mathbb{C})$」。这一句支持本卡「完整（复形）正是 $dR$ 对应的定义域」这一背景断言。该命题要求正则性（下标 $rh$），是讲义 $D^b_{hol}$ 的加条件版本，故只作背景确认，不用来替代定理本身。", "verdict": "match"}], "anchors": ["源码/chapters/chap5.tex:138-208（定理 5.3.1、定理 5.3.4）"], "broken_anchors": [], "note": ""}
