{"id": "dmod/concept/inverse-image-functor", "status": "external-confirmed", "alignment": "match", "checked_on": "2026-11-19", "checks": [{"source": "nLab", "entry": "D-module", "url": "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/D-module", "last_revised": "2024-07-27", "asserts": "该页「Six operations yoga」一节称「Discussion of six operations yoga for pull-push of (coherent, holonomic) D-modules is in (Bernstein, around p. 18)」，即 $\\mathcal D$-模上确有拉回（逆像）与推回（直像）两族运算并构成六运算；支持卡中「沿 $\\varphi$ 存在逆像函子 $\\varphi^+$、它与直像配对」这一断言。卡内具体构造 $\\varphi^+(V)=\\mathcal D_{X\\to Y}\\otimes_{\\varphi^{-1}\\mathcal D_Y}\\varphi^{-1}V$ 与定理 4.3.6 属讲义 §3，不在该页。", "verdict": "match"}, {"source": "nLab", "entry": "six operations", "url": "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/six+operations", "last_revised": "2026-09-30", "asserts": "该页 Idea 段把六运算规定为「(derived direct image)/(derived inverse image) adjunction $(f^\\ast\\dashv f_\\ast)$」加「$(f_!\\dashv f^!)$」再加张量/内 Hom 伴随，并把 Beck–Chevalley 型基变换列为相容条件；支持卡中「逆像与直像成伴随、且逆像的复合相容性属六运算公理」这一框架断言，具体公式仍以讲义为准。", "verdict": "match"}], "anchors": ["源码/chapters/chap4.tex:347-520（定理 4.3.6、引理 4.3.9、定理 4.3.10）", "源码/chapters/chap4.tex:224-264（$\\varphi^+(M)=\\mathcal D_{X\\to Y}\\otimes_{\\mathcal D_Y}M$、定理 4.2.2）"], "broken_anchors": [], "note": ""}
